===Etymology===
{{m|en|out}} + {{m|en|reach}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# The act or practice of visiting and providing the services (of a [[charity]], [[church]], or other organization) to people who might not otherwise have access to those services.
# The [[extent]] or [[length]] of something.

